  "benefits": {
    "type": "financial",
    "value": "Pays a portion of winter heating costs. For FY 2026, reported statewide benefit levels were: Heating $200 minimum and $600 maximum; Crisis benefit $600 in winter; Weatherization maximum $18,500. Some 2026-2027 local and utility pages indicate benefits may rise for oil-heated and utility-heated households, but the standard LIHEAP/HEAP amounts above are the clearest statewide figures found.",
